# Ultra Spotify

Spotify playback control via spotify_player/CLI.

## When to Use
 "Play music", "Next song", "Search for...", "Create playlist"

## Commands

```bash
# Play/pause
spotify_player playback play
spotify_player playback pause

# Next/previous
spotify_player playback next
spotify_player playback previous

# Search and play
spotify_player search "Bohemian Rhapsody" --type track
spotify_player playback start --uri spotify:track:TRACK_ID

# Current track
spotify_player playback status

# Set volume
spotify_player playback volume 60

# Queue a song
spotify_player playback queue --uri spotify:track:TRACK_ID

# List devices
spotify_player connect device list
```
